<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal ups American Home.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal ups American Home.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal Investment Research said analyst David Saks upgraded American Home Products Corp to long-term outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We see a transition taking place from a past steady eight percent earnings per share growth to a more exciting 15 percent clip,&quot; Saks said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/4 at 60-7/8.</p>
</text>
